message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "torchtransform: fast, batched data augmentation for PyTorch"
type: software
authors:
    -   given-names: Gerben
        name-particle: van
        family-names: Veenendaal
        email: gerbenvv@gmail.com
abstract: "A PyTorch library for data augmentation that fuses every geometric transform of a pipeline into a single resampling and every color transform into a single matrix, draws random parameters per batch element, and transforms images, masks, points and boxes together, in 2D and 3D."
repository-code: "https://github.com/gerbenvv/torchtransform"
url: "https://github.com/gerbenvv/torchtransform"
license: BSD-3-Clause
